1. `conversation_memory_test` (already registered in CMake when `STRATA_BUILD_CONVERSATION_TESTS=ON`) must pass; add cases: `"MemAvailable: 1234 kB\n"` → 1,263,616; `"MemAvailable: 12x4 kB\n"` → nullopt; `"MemTotal: 1 kB\n"` (no MemAvailable) → nullopt.
